date 2026-08-16
tags All Life Fiction Poems
title The Black Hole

singleAuthor.scroll

Black hole
Dominant term
Spin round
Always closer

***

Look Away
Still There
Pretend Gone
Still There
Ignore It
Still There
Always Closer

***

Launch Rockets
Also Pulled
Says Nothing
Claims All

***

Resistance Futile
Resist Anyway
Not Today
Face Someday

****

